          "name": "documentation.md",
          "contents": "# Fitness Dashboard Debug Notes\n\nFor each bug, include:\n- what you clicked  \n- what happened to the state  \n- what should have happened  \n- what caused the issue  \n\n## Bug 1\n- I clicked:\n- The state changed to:\n- I expected:\n- I think the problem is:\n\n## Bug 2\n- I clicked:\n- The state changed to:\n- I expected:\n- I think the problem is:\n\n## Bug 3\n- I clicked:\n- The state changed to:\n- I expected:\n- I think the problem is:\n\n## Bug 4\n- I clicked:\n- The state changed to:\n- I expected:\n- I think the problem is:\n\n## Bug 5\n- I clicked:\n- The state changed to:\n- I expected:\n- I think the problem is:",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
